WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:01.850
Morning.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.860
Guten Morgen!

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.690
I'm Oribe Yasuna.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.460
I think I'm in high school!

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:19.460
Good morning!

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.700
Oh, Yasuna.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.940
You're so mean, Sonya-chan!

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.010
This happens every day. Can't you remember?

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:29.770
And I do this to you every day.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:30.850
Learn your lesson already.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.880
This is my classmate, Sonya-chan.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.950
She does a special type of work.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.660
And that is...

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.320
Hang on. You have something on you.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.620
Apparently, she's an assassin.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:03.170
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:13.860
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.090
doushita no wasa wasa

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.090
What's up? Rustle! Rustle!

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.300
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.420
nan demo naamin

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.420
Absolutely Naamin

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.660
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:19.940
yarunara camo camo

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:19.940
Let's do it! Come on! Come on!

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.110
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:22.560
nandato don!

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:22.560
What'd you say?! Boom!

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:27.110
itsumo on-site dakedo slow ride

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:27.110
You're always on-site, but that's why it's a slow ride

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:31.850
homie ni doujinai haraise de toiki da

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:31.850
Homie's nothin' to me! For stress, it's a long sigh

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:33.960
gachi sugite girigiri tomosureba

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:33.960
You're trying too hard, it's a close call

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.380
piroshiki motoi dewa auchi nakayoshi

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.380
Pirozhki rather! Then? Ouch, friends!

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.720
koborusuki mizoochi

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.720
Kowalski to the pit of your stomach!

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:38.630
forishi!

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:38.630
Holy shit!

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.130
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.380
asobou yo wasa wasa

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.380
Let's play! Rustle! Rustle!

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.570
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:47.710
damatte naamin

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:47.710
Quiet, Naamin

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:48.950
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:50.220
doushitemo camo camo

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:50.220
Please! Come on! Come on!

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:51.410
Kill Me Baby!

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:52.890
urusai don!

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:52.890
Shut up! Bang!

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.600
itsumo all right dakedo so tight

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.600
We're always all right, but that's why we're so tight

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:02.060
kougina best friend nagashime de dotsukuna!

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:02.060
We're best friends, so don't punch me while staring like that!

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.950
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.130
kondo ha wasa wasa

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.130
Now then! Rustle! Rustle!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.360
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.450
nanda yo naamin

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.450
What now, Naamin?

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.710
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:18.920
mada mada camo camo

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:18.920
Still going! Come on! Come on!

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.160
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.370
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.530
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:23.760
Kill Me Baby!

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:26.460
don!

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:26.460
Boom!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.330
It's morning.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.670
Sonya-chan, you're way too tense.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.990
I know you're an assassin, but still!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.870
I don't know if someone is after me,

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:41.990
so I have to stay on my toes.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.200
Oh no! Oh no!

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.570
Oh, it's just a broken vase.

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:55.380
Sonya-chan, you're a bit of a scaredy cat, huh?

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.720
What are you talking about?

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.680
Being wary and being a scaredy cat

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.930
are very different.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.690
Oh my God! A roach!

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.900
So you're scared of cockroaches?

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.260
I'm just being cautious of a hygienic threat.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.190
These kinds of books are scary...

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:19.500
I didn't think I'd read the whole thing.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:24.760
Sonya-chan, are you scared of ghosts, too?

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.700
N-No, I'm not really scared of them...

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:30.100
It's just that I don't know if
I can keep one in a headlock...

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.050
I don't know what I'd do if someone
hired me to take care of one.

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:35.980
They'd already be dead so you'd be fine?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.470
Around lunchtime.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.260
Hey, Sonya-chan!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:47.240
Could you teach me some of your moves?

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.480
Why do you want to know?

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.270
Well, you're my friend and an assassin,

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.440
so I figured I'd learn at least
something about self-defense from you.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.980
But I don't want something that can kill.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.360
Something easy to learn should work.

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:01.320
Easy to learn?

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.320
Well...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.400
With this, you can poke out someone's eyeballs.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.240
Stop! That's too harsh, so no dice!

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:10.150
Okay, this is for when you're grabbed by your shirt.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.320
Oh! This seems practical.

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:16.460
—react...

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.430
you'll send your opponent to heaven in one hit.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:27.390
People who can do that don't need to learn self-defense...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.080
Sonya-chan, I don't have a bottle opener.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.150
Can you open this for me?

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.440
Why me?

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.610
Do it yourself.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:46.200
C'mon, don't say that!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.550
Thanks!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.020
Now I can drink it.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.290
She used me?!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.470
That was delicious!

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:00.480
Sheesh.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.970
Making me use my skills on something so pointless...

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.470
Huh? I can't open it...

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.020
Guess I've got no choice.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.890
You'll use it for yourself?

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:19.930
Th-This is practice for work,

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:21.450
so it's okay.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.820
So you're a bottle assassin!

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:24.990
Yeah! That's it!

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:28.630
I request that you "kill" this bottle for me as part of your work.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.950
You bought another one?

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.510
Please do!

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.190
What on Earth am I doing?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.710
Ooh! Just like a pro!

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.210
I'll take the contents as a reward, then.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:45.400
You drank it all!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.550
It was actually pretty good.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.180
How dare you!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.410
You're so mean!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.480
It was just a water gun!

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.120
Sorry.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.070
Reflex.

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:07.080
I'm not like you! Why would I have a real gun?

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:10.020
Why would you bring a water gun to school?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:11.870
Gotcha!

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.800
You missed again!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.480
You sure about that?

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.920
My yakisoba sandwich!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.090
You...

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.920
Don't waste food like that!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:26.840
Woah! She actually reacted seriously!

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.340
You can still eat wet bread!

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:30.430
Yeah?

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:31.920
Then how about <i>you</i> eat it?!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.560
Delicious...

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:43.580
She cried...

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.030
Sheesh.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:51.810
Why do I have to buy a yakisoba
sandwich twice in one day?

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:55.170
I'd like some croquette bread next.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.650
You're still hungry?

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.880
It-it-it's a dog!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.910
Oh no! What do we do?

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.770
He's small, but what if he bites us?

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.680
Look! Sonya's pumped up!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.530
Help us, Sonya!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:18.060
No. She just evacuated to higher ground.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:21.130
Don't worry! You can do it!

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:22.670
Get rid of the dog!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.670
It's not that easy...

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.240
You're a pro assassin, and yet
you can't get rid of a little dog?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.830
Fine. If you're going to go that far,

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.200
I'll take care of him as a pro!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.960
Prepare yourself, dog!

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.170
Said pro's using a weapon against a dog...

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.190
This dog's been trained!

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.180
He's just an ordinary stray.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:56.140
Then... eat this!

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:02.540
He really ate it.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.740
You damned dog...

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:08.410
Then I will use my lunch to do something!

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.660
You're just doing that since
you're full after eating my lunch.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.320
Using the contents of my lunch box...

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:17.450
I'll lead him to the exit, one piece at a time.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.190
I ran out halfway!

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.370
You're useless!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.370
Ah! I just thought of something!

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:24.200
If we stick this on him,

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.480
he'll go off somewhere on his own!

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.370
I went and made it.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.700
Who's going to put it on him?

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:45.580
Yay! Fried chicken!

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.220
Just kidding.

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:48.420
I know!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.840
If we let him eat enough,

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.830
he might just leave on his own!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.110
I see!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.340
I bought a bunch of food!

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.540
Good! Give it here!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:02.640
Yeah!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.700
Eat! Eat!

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.420
Go! Eat!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:07.500
Eat!

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:13.850
She tamed him.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.070
After school.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.610
Sonya-chan, whenever someone gets close to
you, your hands automatically move, right?

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:23.670
I guess so.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:26.270
Does that help with anything but defending yourself?

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.800
Well...

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.660
I don't need insect repellent.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:37.270
Hey, I just saw another roach!

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:39.060
It just flew somewhere...

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.220
That's weird...

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.440
Where did it go?

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:44.460
I got a fly swatter!

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.870
That was a horrible experience.

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:08.940
You sure used a lot of antiseptic solution.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:11.070
Today's been one hell of a day.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.790
I've lost my self-confidence.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:17.030
It's okay!

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.860
I'm here for you.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:22.050
I'll always be your friend!

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.170
Yasuna...

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.870
So don't worry so much!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:28.670
Okay?

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:32.380
Ah! You're so mean!

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:40.340
Sonya-chan!

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.360
Danke schön!

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:47.800
I'm Oribe Yasuna!

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.780
In all probability, I'm in high school!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.700
If I go in from behind, she'll hit me...

00:10:55.700 --> 00:10:57.070
Good morning!

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:13.480
During the day.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.050
Hey, Sonya-chan.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:18.310
I've heard rumors about a
ghost appearing in a classroom.

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:19.630
Wanna check it out with me?

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:21.610
Why do you want me to come?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.640
Go by yourself.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:27.190
If you don't, I'll just put my
scary photo album in your desk.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:28.500
G-Get rid of that!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.780
Get away from me!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:34.780
Damn.

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.790
She got me to tag along.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.550
So anyway, about that ghost.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.660
They say it hangs from the ceiling.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:47.380
Wouldn't that become a problem if
there's a fire and the smoke rises up?

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:48.300
I wonder.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.510
And here we are, at the rumored classroom!

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.270
Now, if you would.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.910
You mean me?!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.930
Well, that's fine.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:58.970
I'll take a look.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:00.950
Oh! So brave!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.270
<i>But she's not unarmed.</i>

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:04.900
Okay. Let's go.

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:12.810
She threw it as a diversion.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:19.510
You're overreacting.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.650
There's nothing here.

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:31.540
Here's my chance!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:34.450
Nice... Nice...!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.870
Don't take pictures!

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.010
Nice...!

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:38.930
This is...

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:41.520
What's that?

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.090
A shuriken.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:46.350
Now that I think about it, there
was a ninja in my organization.

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.480
Ninja?

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:51.810
Do you mean that person over there
who's been playing the part for a while?

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:54.190
That's so lame.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.430
Is this your friend?

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:57.950
Embarrassingly, yes.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:00.610
Hey, come out of there.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:05.910
That's the famous "body substitution" jutsu.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.330
It's been a while, Sonya.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.630
I knew it was you.

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.860
Hello! Nice to meet you.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:16.720
I'm Goshiki Agiri.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.760
Here, have this.

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:21.290
Oh, thanks...

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.940
Wait, a shuriken?

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:24.560
—No, a business card?!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:28.040
So, why are you here?

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:31.490
I had to change schools because of work.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:35.430
And then I heard about this
school having a ninja club.

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:38.930
I thought I'd join because of what I do,

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.760
but it died out 40 years ago!

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.840
This was the classroom for that club.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.450
Stop hanging around here, then.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.690
Agiri-san, since you're a ninja,

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:49.900
does that mean you can do all sorts of ninja tricks?

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.420
Of course.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:58.620
Ninja technique: "You're getting very sleeeepy" jutsu!

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:09.110
Hey.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.440
Ah! You just fell asleep.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:12.560
No, I didn't!

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:18.220
Everyone who falls for that jutsu says that.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.360
Huh?

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:21.230
I fell asleep.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:22.030
Don't fall for it!

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:32.460
This last one I'll show you is a big hit overseas.

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:34.380
"A big hit"?

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.190
Now, now.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.670
This one is actually a ninja technique.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:41.380
So you admit the other ones weren't?!

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:42.750
See?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.850
Amazing, right?

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:48.220
So you <i>were</i> the ghost.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.900
I call this one:

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:54.610
Ninja technique: "Have your hair stay up
even when you're upside down" jutsu.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:55.980
It's about the hair?!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.670
My skirt stays up, too.

00:14:58.670 --> 00:15:01.110
That's amazing, but it's kind of plain.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.590
Nice... Nice...!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:08.160
Nice... Nice...!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:12.000
Anyway, it was nice to meet you.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.330
Here.

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.790
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.030
That's a prop for my ninja techniques.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:21.170
Explosives really give a "ninja" feel, don't you think?

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:30.840
Agiri-san really is a weird one, isn't she?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.920
I never know what's going through her head.

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:37.910
Oh well, I got some embarrassing pictures of you.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.740
Huh?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.070
That's right!

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:42.010
Give it here!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.300
On another day.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.190
Where's Agiri-san?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.550
She wasn't in the clubroom.

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:14.480
Oh, there she is.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.940
Agiri-san!

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.820
Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.590
Body substitution jutsu...!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:25.570
Don't take my mistaking someone else for you as one of your techniques!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.560
You were looking for me?

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:33.260
Yes!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:37.000
I was wondering if you could teach me some ninja
techniques to defend myself against Sonya-chan.

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:40.460
Oh, so you want to be my apprentice?

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:41.380
No, that's not what I...

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:43.560
First off, go buy me some bread.

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:52.840
<i>I didn't think I'd actually buy it...</i>

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:57.030
Okay, so shall we try some shuriken practice?

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.440
But isn't that really hard?

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:01.610
Well... yes, I guess.

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:03.660
How about something with a gun?!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.130
If you really want,

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.530
I have everything from bazookas to machine guns.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:15.340
Well, for now, I'd like to learn
the body substitution jutsu!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:18.510
Let's begin the lesson, then!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.210
Huh? But you haven't taught me anything yet—

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:26.880
Well done!

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:34.910
Now let's move onto the clone jutsu.

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:36.690
Did I pass with that?

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:39.850
Wait, can you really clone yourself?

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.890
But of course.

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:47.560
How's this?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:50.800
Wow!

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:52.290
You really can!

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:54.290
There are so many copies of you!

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:56.900
What just happened?

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.500
Its ingredients are all natural!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.150
It's true.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:05.280
Well? Have you remembered those techniques?

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.260
Well, not quite...

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:13.510
In that case, I'll give you this set of secret scrolls that allow you to use any technique with ease.

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:17.520
Each one is 800 yen.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.190
<i>That's a realistic price.</i>

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:23.530
Well, consider it a special bonus.

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:25.400
In exchange,

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:28.780
I'd like you to accompany me during my next ninja techniques training.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:29.740
Sure.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:30.610
What kind of training?

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.870
Ninja technique: "Hell Descent."

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:36.580
Why are you bringing out
the extreme techniques now?!

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:41.720
Ninja technique: Hell Descent.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:44.250
And another day.

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.720
Let's give this a try!

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.630
It's just another sham.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:53.200
We'll see about that!

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.410
Flame jutsu!

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.250
No way!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.690
The other ones have to be real!

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:11.610
...use fire to light the fuse.

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:14.200
I see!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.980
That's what the flame jutsu is for...

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.110
Idiot!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.250
Wh-What was that for?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.160
Do you want us to have afros again, you idiot?!

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.260
Give it to me!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.320
The others may be dangerous too.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.800
That's the water jutsu!

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.580
It's just a water bottle.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.300
That one's the ant hell jutsu!

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:34.970
It's just an ant farm.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:36.930
Toad jutsu!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.470
A large-sized sesame seed.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:42.520
Sesame.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:48.500
As for the last one, the far-viewing jutsu...

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:52.990
It was just a telescope.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.530
There were no techniques...

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:01.630
It pisses me off how far you can see with this thing.

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.800
D-Did you see something?!

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:15.410
Ninjas are amazing!

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:16.380
Ninja?

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.270
Agiri-san is flying!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:26.190
Oh, it's just a picture.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:32.200
Just goes to show that you
can't trust her techniques.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.150
She can see me?!

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:47.720
Far-viewing jutsu?

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.950
It's a secret.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:13.950
It's pretty warm out.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:16.890
And the sun's shining just right.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:18.410
Look!

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:23.070
Oh, I know!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.600
Let's watch the cherry blossoms, Sonya-chan!

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.790
Sure, I don't mind.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:39.050
Why don't you just get a bottle opener
if you're going to buy bottled juice?

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:50.500
It's beautiful, isn't it, Sonya-chan?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.770
Yeah.

00:21:58.270 --> 00:21:59.910
Sonya-chan, there's a petal on your—

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:09.150
Dog, Ninja, Cherry Blossoms.
